     body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> oooo damask would look really nice!!! Definitely harder to find.... I'll keep my eyes peeled!<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>canadiangirl<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Yeah i love the look of them...but the FMIL wants me to go with the ones that match the table runners lol ....... which if you remember is the same as our door hangers (BLACK AND WHITE DAMSAK) look.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> but im a little worried that it will be too much, but in the same time look really well put together!!???? im confused on\u00a0 this one lol<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"torilynnsmith@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1305063935,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-239852.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"torilynnsmith","Id":239852,"Name":"torilynnsmith","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64132,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5a1987d0bad097aea7118a941b4f2c7b","RawContent":"come on now...... you know me, ive already found them!!! i dont know how lol lol but i swear its fate that this be my theme, ive found everything ive been looking for so far.... and the price is really good too, they are 3.99 for the table runners and if I remember right the chair sashes are 1.59-2.00 each. \n \n you dont think it will be too much damask?\n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]torilynnsmith[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n oooo damask would look really nice!!! Definitely harder to find.... I&#039;ll keep my eyes peeled!\n   \n \n \n[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1541425,"PostDate":1320100633,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> come on now...... you know me, ive already found them!!! i dont know how lol lol but i swear its fate that this be my theme, ive found everything ive been looking for so far.... and the price is really good too, they are 3.99 for the table runners and if I remember right the chair sashes are 1.59-2.00 each.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> you dont think it will be too much damask?<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>torilynnsmith<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> oooo damask would look really nice!!! Definitely harder to find.... I'll keep my eyes peeled!<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span>Two hands will join together on their special day and look at each other and say I DO on April 14 2012 in Montego Bay Jamaica<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"leigh_quiring@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"99.255.122.245","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1305024161,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-239822.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"canadiangirl","Id":239822,"Name":"canadiangirl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64132,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2444c4a2676e9414976009b0622c5f52","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Thanks for sharing.... I&#039;ve been debating chair sashes, but at this price it&#039;s a no brainer!!! I just contacted the seller about buying a larger qty and saving on the shipping :)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1543754,"PostDate":1320676451,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Thanks for sharing.... I've been debating chair sashes, but at this price it's a no brainer!!! I just contacted the seller about buying a larger qty and saving on the shipping <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"pattiandkevin@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1305368383,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-239988.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"pinkinboca","Id":239988,"Name":"pinkinboca","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64132,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"be96e177b249f4600fa4169338dd6e06","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; thanks for sharing!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1543764,"PostDate":1320678002,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> thanks for sharing!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lildior1113@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"199.107.16.121","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1315927910,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-245272.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"chrisdior","Id":245272,"Name":"chrisdior","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64132,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5b46d722914c58b70709f838bc59db2a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Wow thanks for sharing the link, that&#039;s the best price I have seen so far!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1544481,"PostDate":1320785305,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Wow thanks for sharing the link, that's the best price I have seen so far!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"allison.burns@utoronto.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1310295349,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-242154.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Allie2012","Id":242154,"Name":"Allie2012","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64132,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c17d3de3decf1d5452c48d14d1213261","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; This is awesome! I soooo need this&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1544493,"PostDate":1320786804,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> This is awesome! I soooo need this<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mz_priya@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"108.173.31.172","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1313510112,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-243976.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":198,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mizpriya","Id":243976,"Name":"mizpriya","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64132,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cde3749681a15324f62992065b5cef0e","RawContent":"Hey, \n \n I just got quoted on sashes from the hotel.  $4 each!! \n \n I was wondering how accurate the colour was?  I\"m worried it won&#039;t really match the colours I&#039;ve chosen for.  \n \n thanks, [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]torilynnsmith[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Hi Ladies,  \n \n Whenever I find a great deal I just have to share and today my 100 organza chair sashes arrived and I am so pleased with them that I wanted to share with future brides who may be looking to bring their sashes with them! \n \n I ordered my chair sashes from ebay seller [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/572500\/width\/600\/height\/450[\/img] \n sorry it is sideways but you get the idea, they are nice a long so there is no worry that they wont work on different chairs, I even think we will be able to use some to decorate the chuppah![\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1556619,"PostDate":1323785481,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> Hey,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I just got quoted on sashes from the hotel.\u00a0 $4 each!!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I was wondering how accurate the colour was?\u00a0 I\"m worried it won't really match the colours I've chosen for.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> thanks,<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>torilynnsmith<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Hi Ladies,\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Whenever I find a great deal I just have to share and today my 100 organza chair sashes arrived and I am so pleased with them that I wanted to share with future brides who may be looking to bring their sashes with them!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I ordered my chair sashes from ebay seller\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"IMG_3467.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/572500\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> sorry it is sideways but you get the idea, they are nice a long so there is no worry that they wont work on different chairs, I even think we will be able to use some to decorate the chuppah!<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"erica.bowley@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1304450686,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-239601.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"FranticBride2be","Id":239601,"Name":"FranticBride2be","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64132,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"483e67c651a795252f12ace1a8e0fd02","RawContent":"I ordered navy sashes and am VERY happy with the colour.  I was nervous they would maybe be too royal but they are exactly what I need.  We are just using them for a pop of colour as our main colour for decor is the white so I am not trying to match to anything to specifically. \n \n What colour are you looking for? [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]FranticBride2be[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n \n Hey, \n \n I just got quoted on sashes from the hotel.  $4 each!! \n \n I was wondering how accurate the colour was?  I\"m worried it won&#039;t really match the colours I&#039;ve chosen for.  \n \n thanks, \n \n \n[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1556629,"PostDate":1323786261,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> I ordered navy sashes and am VERY happy with the colour. \u00a0I was nervous they would maybe be too royal but they are exactly what I need. \u00a0We are just using them for a pop of colour as our main colour for decor is the white so I am not trying to match to anything to specifically.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> What colour are you looking for?<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>FranticBride2be<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> <br \/> Hey,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I just got quoted on sashes from the hotel.\u00a0 $4 each!!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I was wondering how accurate the colour was?\u00a0 I\"m worried it won't really match the colours I've chosen for.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> thanks,<\/p> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"torilynnsmith@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1305063935,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-239852.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"torilynnsmith","Id":239852,"Name":"torilynnsmith","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64132,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bfe61e9525720484b470d00e869a3ab4","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Thanks for the link! Definitely saving this seller...the prices + free shipping =A++++&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1556749,"PostDate":1323809741,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Thanks for the link! Definitely saving this seller...the prices + free shipping =A++++<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"carismagyrl_00@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"184.151.190.249","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1293348760,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-234802.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"belledame","Id":234802,"Name":"belledame","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":51,"TotalPages":6,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":50},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
