r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Life is too short to be serious...so laugh a little<\/span><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/t\/wP1ahYF\/weight.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...hYF\/weight.png<\/a><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/t\/wisH34o\/exercise.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...o\/exercise.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"bobbettp@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1245892282,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-218780.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":157,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Natural","Id":218780,"Name":"Natural","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":49408,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f3f7a5ea135b788736cc62c75c9f0918","RawContent":"I am getting married at the Jellyfish February 26, 2011! I am not sure if there is a bar definitely upstairs but I have heard of people having a small reception up there so I am assuming there must be. We rented out the place for the night so I think we are having the reception and cocktail hour outside (weather permitting). I actually havent heard back from Mayte in a few days and I am getting nervous!","Attachments":[],"Id":1070059,"PostDate":1268260014,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I am getting married at the Jellyfish February 26, 2011! I am not sure if there is a bar definitely upstairs but I have heard of people having a small reception up there so I am assuming there must be. We rented out the place for the night so I think we are having the reception and cocktail hour outside (weather permitting). I actually havent heard back from Mayte in a few days and I am getting nervous!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span><\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/url%5DMichael\">www.steingardstudios.comMichael<\/a><span> and Phil Steingard are located in Ontario, but travel to Punta Cana quite often during the year. There is a good chance they will be down already during your wedding week, so this will cut back on the travel costs.<\/span><br \/>\n<br \/>\n<span>PM me if you are getting married...<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"adenen16@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1264641650,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-225112.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"adenen16","Id":225112,"Name":"adenen16","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":49408,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3678963d84f37c43c2558b841b7edbad","RawContent":"Okay thanks!","Attachments":[],"Id":1071086,"PostDate":1268327036,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Okay thanks!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Life is too short to be serious...so laugh a little<\/span><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/t\/wP1ahYF\/weight.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...hYF\/weight.png<\/a><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/t\/wisH34o\/exercise.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...o\/exercise.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"bobbettp@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1245892282,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-218780.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":157,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Natural","Id":218780,"Name":"Natural","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":49408,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e569b8e2aa7f44f774df3a6ed20e35d8","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;Natural&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Hello All!!!!\n \n For those who have and\/or are going to use Jellyfish Restaurant I would like to know if there is a bar upstairs. I was thinking it would be nice to have the cocktail hour upstairs and eat dinner downstair. After cocktail hour, upstairs would be a loung area.\n \n Let me know how this sounds please!\n \n Thanks,\n Natural&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;I actually had my wedding reception (March 2009) there...very small group of 15 total. We were seated upstairs and there is no bar up there but there are great views of the beach. However, if you are reserving the entire place, they can probably set one up there for you.","Attachments":[],"Id":1073249,"PostDate":1268434611,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>Natural<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Hello All!!!!<br \/> <br \/> For those who have and\/or are going to use Jellyfish Restaurant I would like to know if there is a bar upstairs. I was thinking it would be nice to have the cocktail hour upstairs and eat dinner downstair. After cocktail hour, upstairs would be a loung area.<br \/> <br \/> Let me know how this sounds please!<br \/> <br \/> Thanks,<br \/> Natural<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>I actually had my wedding reception (March 2009) there...very small group of 15 total. We were seated upstairs and there is no bar up there but there are great views of the beach. However, if you are reserving the entire place, they can probably set one up there for you.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;53;89\/st\/20090310\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/d1cd\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...d1cd\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"marisacover@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1227731684,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-212889.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":67,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"marisacastro","Id":212889,"Name":"marisacastro","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":49408,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0b582db580be67129086b6f4bb3db764","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;Natural&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Thanks I&#039;ve been to there website, I just wanted some feedback from anybody who has been there already. What date in July are you looking at? I&#039;m July 16, 2011&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;i&#039;m getting married july 8th 2011 at the gran bahia principe punta cana\n i&#039;m actually booking my date with the resort this weekend!!!!! :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1073882,"PostDate":1268505113,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>Natural<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Thanks I've been to there website, I just wanted some feedback from anybody who has been there already. What date in July are you looking at? I'm July 16, 2011<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>i'm getting married july 8th 2011 at the gran bahia principe punta cana<br \/> i'm actually booking my date with the resort this weekend!!!!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><strong>July 2011<\/strong><br><a data-ipb='nome