  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> <br \/> My WC\/TA is checking out the bus company with the Dominican Republic Dept of Tourism to make sure that they are legit, insured and come recommended. I will let you know if I hear anything.<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>JoandJer<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-bottom: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-right: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> <br \/> sounds like you can trasport your guests to and from the restaurant on a bus for around $5\/person....sounds awesome!<br \/> <br \/> does anyone know the max amount of people you can take?<br \/> <br \/> more importantly, i'm wondering about the safety of a bus trip back from the restaurant to our resort late at night? thoughts?\u00a0<span _fck_bookmark=\"1\"  style=\"display: none\">\u00a0<\/span><\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ksheahan3@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1260302736,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-223798.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KJ Shea","Id":223798,"Name":"KJ Shea","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":49408,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0e3d1003490071bba7c4a8c069268f92","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; @KJ Shea...&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Oh, is the Dominican Republic Dept of Tourism the bus company used by the Jellyfish?!&amp;nbsp; I didn&#039;t realize that. Thanks for the heads up!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; \n Yah, I would so appreciate if you wouldn&#039;t mind passing along anything you happen to find out about them!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Thanks for the reply!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[{"Id":3712,"Name":"weddingg stuff 008.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2010\/post-19162-138237660484.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2010\/post-19162-138237660484_thumb.jpg","Width":486,"Height":648},{"Id":3713,"Name":"IMG_0330.JPG","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2010\/post-19162-138237660491.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2010\/post-19162-138237660491_thumb.jpg","Width":653,"Height":490},{"Id":3714,"Name":"IMG_0234.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2010\/post-19162-138237660496.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2010\/post-19162-138237660496_thumb.jpg","Width":816,"Height":612},{"Id":3715,"Name":"IMG_0228.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2010\/post-19162-138237660512.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2010\/post-19162-138237660512_thumb.jpg","Width":816,"Height":612},{"Id":3716,"Name":"IMG_0244.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2010\/post-19162-138237660519.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2010\/post-19162-138237660519_thumb.jpg","Width":816,"Height":612},{"Id":3717,"Name":"IMG_0260.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2010\/post-19162-138237660526.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly