\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi! Could someone please email me the cost sheet as well? Looking into an October 2014 wedding with 50 guests. Does anyone have any resort recommendations? Thanks! Mikalahburton@gmail.com\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Mikalahburton@gmail.com","IpAddress":"107.207.78.78","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1386108562,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275477.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Mikalahburton","Id":275477,"Name":"Mikalahburton","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.250.150.23","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73031,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b0b8793363fde514e906cf202f2fb352","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi all! I&#039;m getting married March 2014 at Now Larimar, but now I&#039;m second guessing on having my reception there due to pricing and decorations. Can someone please send me the pricing list for Jellyfish to &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;mailto:catlinwedding@[member=\"gmail\"].com&#039;&gt;catlinwedding@[member=\"gmail\"].com&lt;\/a&gt;.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks!!!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1819682,"PostDate":1387318195,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi all! I'm getting married March 2014 at Now Larimar, but now I'm second guessing on having my reception there due to pricing and decorations. Can someone please send me the pricing list for Jellyfish to <a href='mailto:catlinwedding@<a hovercard-ref=' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span itemprop=\"name\">gmail<\/span><\/a>.com'>catlinwedding@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"219734\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/219734-gmail\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">gmail<\/span><\/a>.com<\/a>.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks!!!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"catlinwedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.250.150.23","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1387316942,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"sharshar1018","Id":275669,"Name":"sharshar1018","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.46.152.50","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73031,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a6733eba00d3c0415a68ff228bf71aac","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Can I please get a copy of the invoice?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks a bunch!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;mailto:mroesler@hotmail.com&#039;&gt;mroesler@hotmail.com&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1819706,"PostDate":1387359889,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Can I please get a copy of the invoice?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks a bunch!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='mailto:mroesler@hotmail.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>mroesler@hotmail.com<\/a><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mroesler@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"66.46.152.50","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1380277731,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-273815.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mroesler","Id":273815,"Name":"mroesler","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.62.102.58","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73031,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7eebec2405fb9d3d467e7c71f803c966","RawContent":"I feel the same way. I&#039;m finding Now Larimar to be quite pricey with few rewards for rooms booked. :([quote name=\"sharshar1018\" post=\"1819682\" timestamp=\"1387332595\"]\nHi all! I&#039;m getting married March 2014 at Now Larimar, but now I&#039;m second guessing on having my reception there due to pricing and decorations. Can someone please send me the pricing list for Jellyfish to [email=\"catlinwedding@%5Bmember=\"]catlinwedding@[member=\"gmail\"].com[\/email].\n\n\nThanks!!!![\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1821469,"PostDate":1388618544,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I feel the same way. I'm finding Now Larimar to be quite pricey with few rewards for rooms booked. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/><\/p>\n<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>sharshar1018, on 17 December 2013 - 10:09 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hi all! I'm getting married March 2014 at Now Larimar, but now I'm second guessing on having my reception there due to pricing and decorations. Can someone please send me the pricing list for Jellyfish to <a href='mailto:catlinwedding@%5Bmember=' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>catlinwedding@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"219734\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/219734-gmail\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">gmail<\/span><\/a>.com<\/a>.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks!!!!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jareese425@gmail.com","IpAddress":"75.177.5.32","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1386966432,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"jareese425","Id":275617,"Name":"jareese425","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.193.212.168","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73031,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1a2f0981b97d73dfdd70796637b6bad1","RawContent":"&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;Hi Everyone.. I hope all is well.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;Does anyone have a new updated menu\/wedding services\/bar list with the new prices? Not sure if the prices have change. I have the 2013 list with pricing.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;If so would you be so kind to send it to me at corteewedding@yahoo.com&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;Thank you!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1821472,"PostDate":1388618757,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">Hi Everyone.. I hope all is well.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">Does anyone have a new updated menu\/wedding services\/bar list with the new prices? Not sure if the prices have change. I have the 2013 list with pricing.<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">If so would you be so kind to send it to me at corteewedding@yahoo.com<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">Thank you!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mochalatte222@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"68.193.212.168","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1362055813,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266690.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":165,"PhotoHeight":168,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TeeL","Id":266690,"Name":"TeeL","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"73031","Title":"TOTAL COST OF WEDDING AT JELLYFISH PUNTA CANA","LastPostDate":1443710302},"Pages":{"TotalItems":100,"TotalPages":10,"CurrentPage":60,"NextPage":70,"PreviousPage":50,"LastPage":90},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
