{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.49.95.106","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73031,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6a6313c55998cfa3a98329a5bdbaf67b","RawContent":"[quote name=\"sadafak\" post=\"1803081\" timestamp=\"1380256016\"]\n\nQuote:\nOriginally Posted by [b]cmingalone[\/b] [img]http:\/\/\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif[\/img]\n \nHere you go-hope this helps!\n \n\n\n \n\n\n \n\n\n \n\nHello :)\nDo you mind emailing me the appetizer price list? I have all the other menu and price lists I guess she forgot to attach it when she emailed me. \nI would really appreciate it!\nmonica.azad@[member=\"gmail\"].com\n[\/quote]Hi Can someone email me the price lists for Jellyfish.. I cant see the attachments :(  Nicolecd86@[member=\"gmail\"].com,\n\nThanks!!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1836830,"PostDate":1394031764,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>sadafak, on 27 September 2013 - 12:26 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div>Quote:\n<div>Originally Posted by <strong>cmingalone<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" alt=\"go_quote.gif\"><\/span><br>\n\u00a0\n<p>Here you go-hope this helps!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<span>\u00a0<\/span>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<span>\u00a0<\/span>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<span>\u00a0<\/span>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<span>\u00a0<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hello <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br>\nDo you mind emailing me the appetizer price list? I have all the other menu and price lists I guess she forgot to attach it when she emailed me.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I would really appreciate it!<\/p>\n<p>monica.azad@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"219734\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/219734-gmail\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">gmail<\/span><\/a>.com<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Hi Can someone email me the price lists for Jellyfish.. I cant see the attachments <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/> \u00a0Nicolecd86@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"219734\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/219734-gmail\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">gmail<\/span><\/a>.com,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks!!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nicolecd86@gmail.com","IpAddress":"64.49.95.106","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1392992291,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"nicolecd86","Id":276810,"Name":"nicolecd86","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"74.101.237.242","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73031,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c77dc50a6db2bb11e0309c80a5f1b53e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Can someone me email me the cost of a wedding at the Jellyfish with how many guest, menu, and open bar choice.. Greatly appreciated Lindadinh7@hotmail.com&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1836914,"PostDate":1394061435,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Can someone me email me the cost of a wedding at the Jellyfish with how many guest, menu, and open bar choice.. Greatly appreciated Lindadinh7@hotmail.com<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lindadinh7@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"74.101.237.242","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1392460032,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Lindadinh7","Id":276721,"Name":"Lindadinh7","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.201.193.105","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73031,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3c739c98750127ccbebeeaa59784b5e9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Could someone also e-mail me the prices for Jellyfish? Also has anyone had their ceremony at a resort and just the reception at Jellyfish?!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1837168,"PostDate":1394199880,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Could someone also e-mail me the prices for Jellyfish? Also has anyone had their ceremony at a resort and just the reception at Jellyfish?!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"carly.morrison@sasktel.net","IpAddress":"64.201.193.105","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1394197299,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"FormattedName":"carmor2","Id":277041,"Name":"carmor2","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.63.152.19","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73031,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a8da9ae104ef75da7a4f75857ce83128","RawContent":"carly.morrison@sasktel.net","Attachments":[],"Id":1837327,"PostDate":1394291817,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                carly.morrison@sasktel.net\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"carly.morrison@sasktel.net","IpAddress":"64.201.193.105","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1394197299,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"FormattedName":"carmor2","Id":277041,"Name":"carmor2","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.14.108.135","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73031,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1394385144,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"aaeec594c70ac9f42e1deec15ed062c8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I would like the price list as well , I emailed Mayte last night hope she gets back to me soon ... If anyone has the price list for all services for 2014 that would be greatly appreciated.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;telie7@hotmail.com&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thank you&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1837449,"PostDate":1394384747,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I would like the price list as well , I emailed Mayte last night hope she gets back to me soon ... If anyone has the price list for all services for 2014 that would be greatly appreciated.<\/p>\n<p>telie7@hotmail.com<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thank you<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"telie7@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"108.14.108.135","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1366839462,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268948.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MrsMartinez2B","Id":268948,"Name":"MrsMartinez2B","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.45.232.15","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73031,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c1cfbadf0026a2d61de1ec39133d6183","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi Brides! After reading so many great reviews on the jellyfish I am thinking about a 2015 wedding here- would it be possible if &amp;nbsp;any of you to forward pricing &amp;amp; details for weddings here to my email - butlerb102@yahoo.com? I would be extremely grateful as I am a bit\/very overwhelmed! &amp;nbsp;Thank you!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1839040,"PostDate":1395176197,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi Brides! After reading so many great reviews on the jellyfish I am thinking about a 2015 wedding here- would it be possible if \u00a0any of you to forward pricing & details for weddings here to my email - butlerb102@yahoo.com? I would be extremely grateful as I am a bit\/very overwhelmed! \u00a0Thank you!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"butlerb102@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"24.45.232.15","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1395175421,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Bonni","Id":277221,"Name":"Bonni","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.126.134.178","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73031,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"39d7e89d564957833b8e5c336855936c","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Kaiden1215\" post=\"1833041\" timestamp=\"1392075917\"]\nContact me! My wedding is also At Jellyfish April 2015.[\/quote]Can you send me any info that you have on pricing? I am trying to figure out if I can afford jellyfish before I get my heart set on it! We are looking at May 2015.\n\nJessrow@gmail.com","Attachments":[],"Id":1839598,"PostDate":1395347257,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Kaiden1215, on 10 February 2014 - 07:45 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Contact me! My wedding is also At Jellyfish April 2015.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nCan you send me any info that you have on pricing? I am trying to figure out if I can afford jellyfish before I get my heart set on it! We are looking at May 2015.<br><br>\nJessrow@gmail.com\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jessrow@gmail.com","IpAddress":"50.76.230.114","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1395050619,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277181.jpg?_r=1395070938","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":262,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jessrow715","Id":277181,"Name":"jessrow715","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.224.181.61","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73031,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7fef3d6b0af4461f56500f9d3deeebb5","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Mady28\" post=\"1730337\" timestamp=\"1362625639\"]\nHey Asha, I don&#039;t think I can include attachments if you want give me your email.[\/quote]Hey Mady, anyway you can also forward me that attachment, I am also looking for prices :)  brittany.lynn88@hotmail.com\n\nthanks so much!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1847476,"PostDate":1398807294,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Mady28, on 06 March 2013 - 11:07 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hey Asha, I don't think I can include attachments if you want give me your email.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Hey Mady, anyway you can also forward me that attachment, I am also looking for prices <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> \u00a0brittany.lynn88@hotmail.com<br><br>\nthanks so much!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"brittany.lynn88@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"99.224.181.61","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1398807096,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"barrettbride","Id":277778,"Name":"barrettbride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.104.234.237","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":73031,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1412333995,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cba28f77355a03a0d160205adbd53596","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I have the 2013 price list and apparently nothing is changing from it for 2014 or 2015 except in 2015 the price for exclusive use will increase.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;However, I would love to see invoices from past brides.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1848247,"PostDate":1399241530,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I have the 2013 price list and apparently nothing is changing from it for 2014 or 2015 except in 2015 the price for exclusive use will increase.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>However, I would love to see invoices from past brides.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"-S","Email":"xkittix@gmail.com","IpAddress":"208.104.234.237","GroupId":5,"GroupName":"Banned","JoinDate":1338903286,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-256276.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":152,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"shaeshae18","Id":256276,"Name":"shaeshae18","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.29.205.56","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73031,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3dba5eb94e9167295c3bc4cf630a1fd2","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi All,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m exploring the Jelly Fish for 2015 as well. Can someone please email me estimated costs to the following email address?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);text-align:center;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:rgb(247,247,247);\"&gt;juanandnidia2015@[member=\"gmail\"].com&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;Thank you!!!! :)&lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1860567,"PostDate":1405636809,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n          