,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2a23bc4596eff926318876771aaaf3cb","RawContent":"[quote name=\"lboettle\" post=\"1782347\" timestamp=\"1374661852\"]\nCould someone send me the menu pricing and wedding information as well? We are looking to get married November of 2014. My email is lboettle@kent.edu! Thank you![\/quote]\nIf you don&#039;t mind me asking what place did you pick I&#039;m trying to start planning my wedding and don&#039;t know where to start","Attachments":[],"Id":1872292,"PostDate":1411078557,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>lboettle, on 24 July 2013 - 06:30 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Could someone send me the menu pricing and wedding information as well? We are looking to get married November of 2014. My email is lboettle@kent.edu! Thank you!<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nIf you don't mind me asking what place did you pick I'm trying to start planning my wedding and don't know where to start\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jparedes1215@aol.com","IpAddress":"172.56.12.94","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1410976655,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"joacevedo15","Id":279880,"Name":"joacevedo15","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.140.19.169","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73031,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ee1063c60d8bf922fa70de0f4ae0e734","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"joacevedo15\"] Hello! We choose RIU Palace Bavaro and we loved it! Jellyfish takes forever to get in!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1872312,"PostDate":1411114897,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279880\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279880-joacevedo15\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">joacevedo15<\/span><\/a> Hello! We choose RIU Palace Bavaro and we loved it! Jellyfish takes forever to get in!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lboettle@kent.edu","IpAddress":"64.140.19.169","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1374567786,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271826.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lboettle","Id":271826,"Name":"lboettle","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"73.160.186.129","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73031,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"816099f860876c097844058786b3b450","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi,&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Can someone send me their pricing and packages that Jellyfish offer? I&#039;m interested in having my wedding there. Thanks so much!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;My email is katandminwedding@[member=\"gmail\"].com&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1872576,"PostDate":1411344743,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi,\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Can someone send me their pricing and packages that Jellyfish offer? I'm interested in having my wedding there. Thanks so much!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My email is katandminwedding@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"219734\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/219734-gmail\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">gmail<\/span><\/a>.com<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"katandminwedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"73.160.186.129","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1411344479,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"katandmin","Id":279927,"Name":"katandmin","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.0.254.239","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73031,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d34212225829c336c669596ff10b954e","RawContent":"I am also interested in the costs of the jellyfish anyone with info please email it to Dpeixoto34@[member=\"gmail\"].com\n\n\nThank You! :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1873476,"PostDate":1411749192,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I am also interested in the costs of the jellyfish anyone with info please email it to Dpeixoto34@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"219734\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/219734-gmail\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">gmail<\/span><\/a>.com<br><br>\nThank You! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dpeixoto34@gmail.com","IpAddress":"68.0.254.239","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1411748436,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Desiree921","Id":280040,"Name":"Desiree921","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.38.3.13","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73031,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1b9c833716b21fd81db6c388c70dc2ed","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I would like to request Jellyfish pricing also. In a bit of a panic as we are currently moving our wedding from Hard Rock Cancun to the Now Larimar as we just could not see our day meet our vision at the HRH Cancun, so now with less than 7 months I am desperately planning from the beginning. I would love any comments or reviews on Jellyfish.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;angelahalbert@[member=\"gmail\"].com&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks ever so much&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1876268,"PostDate":1413798772,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I would like to request Jellyfish pricing also. In a bit of a panic as we are currently moving our wedding from Hard Rock Cancun to the Now Larimar as we just could not see our day meet our vision at the HRH Cancun, so now with less than 7 months I am desperately planning from the beginning. I would love any comments or reviews on Jellyfish.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>angelahalbert@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"219734\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/219734-gmail\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">gmail<\/span><\/a>.com\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks ever so much\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"angela.jackson@urs.com","IpAddress":"208.38.3.13","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1399541909,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277894.jpg?_r=1399556581","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"angelajackson","Id":277894,"Name":"angelajackson","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"72.143.226.195","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73031,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4a24cb85a15b58775c052bfc1844cf00","RawContent":"[quote name=\"angelajackson\" post=\"1876268\" timestamp=\"1413813172\"]\nI would like to request Jellyfish pricing also. In a bit of a panic as we are currently moving our wedding from Hard Rock Cancun to the Now Larimar as we just could not see our day meet our vision at the HRH Cancun, so now with less than 7 months I am desperately planning from the beginning. I would love any comments or reviews on Jellyfish. \n\nangelahalbert@[member=\"gmail\"].com \n\nThanks ever so much[\/quote]Wow Angela!!! What happened!?? Moving not only resorts but countries! Your plans seemed to be coming together at hrh!","Attachments":[],"Id":1876269,"PostDate":1413799357,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>angelajackson, on 20 October 2014 - 09:52 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>I would like to request Jellyfish pricing also. In a bit of a panic as we are currently moving our wedding from Hard Rock Cancun to the Now Larimar as we just could not see our day meet our vision at the HRH Cancun, so now with less than 7 months I am desperately planning from the beginning. I would love any comments or reviews on Jellyfish. <br><br>\nangelahalbert@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"219734\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/219734-gmail\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">gmail<\/span><\/a>.com <br><br>\nThanks ever so much<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nWow Angela!!! What happened!?? Moving not only resorts but countries! Your plans seemed to be coming together at hrh! \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kmkwedding2016@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.72.195.234","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1390242208,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"kmk2016","Id":276231,"Name":"kmk2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"198.200.77.18","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73031,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4df9eda1a2357fdc74bde05c4f81ed0c","RawContent":"Past brides,  hopefully someone can help us out in terms of how much you paid for the reception at Jellyfish and which menu did you go for.  Much appreciated if you can forward me your invoice for the jellyfish portion to butter_shortcake@hotmail.com.  Thanks!","Attachments":[],"Id":1889287,"PostDate":1426386507,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Past brides,  hopefully someone can help us out in terms of how much you paid for the reception at Jellyfish and which menu did you go for.  Much appreciated if you can forward me your invoice for the jellyfish portion to butter_shortcake@hotmail.com.  Thanks!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"diana_zhang05@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"174.116.175.202","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1421235356,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Dzhang","Id":281722,"Name":"Dzhang","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.148.254.252","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73031,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"507d671befccc2098baff657ebef652e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi i know this thread is a little older, but hoping to get some info as well, samwedsnate@[member=\"gmail\"].com&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1891683,"PostDate":1427973757,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi i know this thread is a little older, but hoping to get some info as well, samwedsnate@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"219734\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/219734-gmail\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">gmail<\/span><\/a>.com<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"baybee7@msn.com","IpAddress":"68.148.254.252","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1427470168,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282561.jpg?_r=1431728812","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Sammi2016","Id":282561,"Name":"Sammi2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"207.135.186.34","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73031,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3d935a5dd00db1ff34ec3ebda2546a6c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m very interested in holding my wedding ceremony and reception at the Jellyfish as well, but haven&#039;t heard back from them. Can someone send me pricing options they&#039;ve received? My e-mail is: Angrenee87@yahoo.com.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thank you!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1905776,"PostDate":1443710302,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm very interested in holding my wedding ceremony and reception at the Jellyfish as well, but haven't heard back from them. Can someone send me pricing options they've received? My e-mail is: Angrenee87@yahoo.com.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thank you!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"angela.r.hall87@gmail.com","IpAddress":"207.135.186.34","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1443710106,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"AngRHall","Id":284986,"Name":"AngRHall","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":100,"TotalPages":10,"CurrentPage":90,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":80,"LastPage":90},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
