{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.146.146.173","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79343,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"08c9b921518831c16f14dbab16885ab8","RawContent":"@[member=\"acw271011\"]\n\nI vote pink :)  I used pink and after seeing her orange table runners I was like &#039;doh I should have considered that&#039;. Looked fantastic \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1899736,"PostDate":1435878095,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"232000\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/232000-acw271011\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">acw271011<\/span><\/a><br>\nI vote pink <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>  I used pink and after seeing her orange table runners I was like 'doh I should have considered that'. Looked fantastic <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399414202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"207.164.79.93","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79343,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bcf2c110cb7af2bc89052f46f551ef94","RawContent":"[quote name=\"calgarybride2015\" post=\"1899736\" timestamp=\"1435892495\"]\n@[member=\"acw271011\"]\nI vote pink :)  I used pink and after seeing her orange table runners I was like &#039;doh I should have considered that&#039;. Looked fantastic \n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk[\/quote]I absolutely love the pink. My dilemma is that I also have the turquoise and when I look at the bows to buy the turquoise is also so pretty! Haven&#039;t bought them yet but need to decide sort of soon....\n\nSent from my SGH-I337M using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1899742,"PostDate":1435910351,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>calgarybride2015, on 02 July 2015 - 11:01 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"232000\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/232000-acw271011\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">acw271011<\/span><\/a><br>\nI vote pink <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>  I used pink and after seeing her orange table runners I was like 'doh I should have considered that'. Looked fantastic <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk<\/p><\/div><\/div>\nI absolutely love the pink. My dilemma is that I also have the turquoise and when I look at the bows to buy the turquoise is also so pretty! Haven't bought them yet but need to decide sort of soon....<br><br>\nSent from my SGH-I337M using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><em><span style=\"color:rgb(51,153,255);\">I'm lucky enough to\u00a0tell my husband how much I love him and say yes again\u00a0on October 20, 2015 at Grand Coral Beach Club!\u00a0<\/span><\/em>","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283444599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.146.146.173","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79343,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9045acff30f7e9aff2a29e1696cee69e","RawContent":"[quote name=\"acw271011\" post=\"1899742\" timestamp=\"1435924751\"]\nI absolutely love the pink. My dilemma is that I also have the turquoise and when I look at the bows to buy the turquoise is also so pretty! Haven&#039;t bought them yet but need to decide sort of soon....\n\nSent from my SGH-I337M using Tapatalk[\/quote]I personally like the mixing of colors. I had considered this early on and someone had suggested it wouldn&#039;t look put together. That said, later on again I saw someone use it and I thought it looked fantastic!!! Honestly both colors are pretty so whatever you choose will be nice!! Pink was my main color hence why I went that route. \n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1899747,"PostDate":1435918617,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>acw271011, on 03 July 2015 - 07:59 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>I absolutely love the pink. My dilemma is that I also have the turquoise and when I look at the bows to buy the turquoise is also so pretty! Haven't bought them yet but need to decide sort of soon....<br><br>\nSent from my SGH-I337M using Tapatalk<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nI personally like the mixing of colors. I had considered this early on and someone had suggested it wouldn't look put together. That said, later on again I saw someone use it and I thought it looked fantastic!!! Honestly both colors are pretty so whatever you choose will be nice!! Pink was my main color hence why I went that route. <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399414202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"72.143.70.78","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79343,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0063af9f7d80bb0f92720d2fc756ff83","RawContent":"[quote name=\"calgarybride2015\" post=\"1899747\" timestamp=\"1435933017\"]\nI personally like the mixing of colors. I had considered this early on and someone had suggested it wouldn&#039;t look put together. That said, later on again I saw someone use it and I thought it looked fantastic!!! Honestly both colors are pretty so whatever you choose will be nice!! Pink was my main color hence why I went that route. \nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk[\/quote]lol poor @[member=\"rachelia160\"] - we&#039;re hijacking her wedding review! I totally agree - I love the mixing of the colours too! It&#039;s just to decide how to mix! We&#039;re such a small, small group that I don&#039;t want to overdo the colours. Our arch is going to be draped in turquoise with 2 bouquets of pink flowers, one half way up on each side. So I thought pink chair ties, but then we&#039;re transferring the chair ties to the restaurant in PDC. I wanted to do a table runner because our rectangle table is white linen but if I stick a pink one on the table Doug will have a comment to make about it. lol Typical guy...  Can I combine the pink and turquoise on the table? Then there&#039;s the cake table. Cake is being done in turquoise - do I keep just a white linen cover or do I do a pink table topper? Is it too much colour??","Attachments":[],"Id":1899749,"PostDate":1435924121,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>calgarybride2015, on 03 July 2015 - 10:16 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>I personally like the mixing of colors. I had considered this early on and someone had suggested it wouldn't look put together. That said, later on again I saw someone use it and I thought it looked fantastic!!! Honestly both colors are pretty so whatever you choose will be nice!! Pink was my main color hence why I went that route. <br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nlol poor @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"275855\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/275855-rachelia160\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">rachelia160<\/span><\/a> - we're hijacking her wedding review! I totally agree - I love the mixing of the colours too! It's just to decide how to mix! We're such a small, small group that I don't want to overdo the colours. Our arch is going to be draped in turquoise with 2 bouquets of pink flowers, one half way up on each side. So I thought pink chair ties, but then we're transferring the chair ties to the restaurant in PDC. I wanted to do a table runner because our rectangle table is white linen but if I stick a pink one on the table Doug will have a comment to make about it. lol Typical guy...  Can I combine the pink and turquoise on the table? Then there's the cake table. Cake is being done in turquoise - do I keep just a white linen cover or do I do a pink table topper? Is it too much colour??\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><em><span style=\"color:rgb(51,153,255);\">I'm lucky enough to\u00a0tell my husband how much I love him and say yes again\u00a0on October 20, 2015 at Grand Coral Beach Club!\u00a0<\/span><\/em>","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283444599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.143.121.122","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79343,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c2cf384136572deb7b3d3fe82e981993","RawContent":"Love this review!! Beautiful pictures!! Congratulations!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1899784,"PostDate":1435998937,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Love this review!! Beautiful pictures!! Congratulations!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"pinkiesup08@gmail.com","IpAddress":"75.181.5.152","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1374599724,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271841.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"RandL2015","Id":271841,"Name":"RandL2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"76.119.165.154","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79343,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4c7fb7c7678bb9edca822ea29da5f243","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Congratulations!&amp;nbsp; What a beautiful wedding.&amp;nbsp; Thanks for sharing your experience with us!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1899786,"PostDate":1436004962,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congratulations!\u00a0 What a beautiful wedding.\u00a0 Thanks for sharing your experience with us!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"candice.french@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.62.169.169","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1415106695,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profil