{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"162.90.146.22","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79546,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0f288c2c00e3fb00c5494626d912d48c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi Ladies, does anyone know the pricing for the Buffet option at Dreams La Romana?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1905731,"PostDate":1443688284,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi Ladies, does anyone know the pricing for the Buffet option at Dreams La Romana?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nicole.rosario7@gmail.com","IpAddress":"64.233.172.253","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1442143880,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"nr083273","Id":284797,"Name":"nr083273","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.17.41.18","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79546,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4b2d4d7c51d96eb606b3d39162dd4006","RawContent":"[quote name=\"nr083273\" post=\"1905731\" timestamp=\"1443702684\"]\nHi Ladies, does anyone know the pricing for the Buffet option at Dreams La Romana?[\/quote]\nI have all the options and prices.  If you send me your email address I&#039;ll forward them to you","Attachments":[],"Id":1905732,"PostDate":1443688894,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>nr083273, on 01 October 2015 - 08:31 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Hi Ladies, does anyone know the pricing for the Buffet option at Dreams La Romana?<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nI have all the options and prices.  If you send me your email address I'll forward them to you\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"megewy@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"99.17.41.18","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1437848879,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"MegLeLy","Id":284131,"Name":"MegLeLy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.249.88.127","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79546,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0d2e0d40b9860cf75974103620917993","RawContent":"[quote name=\"MegLeLy\" post=\"1905732\" timestamp=\"1443703294\"]\nI have all the options and prices.  If you send me your email address I&#039;ll forward them to you[\/quote]Thank you again! I sent you a private message \nI truly love this site. So incredibly helpful. I&#039;m looking to get married next year at Dreams La Romana 11\/5\/2016 just waiting to hear back from the WC on how to secure my date.  I reached out to HDC for photography they have great prices.  The also can do the Altos De Chavon wedding shoot so I&#039;m excited about that. \nHow\/ when is everyone planning to send their save the dates and invitations?  I&#039;m still deciding if I should just do everything online and save some.money but I love the passport invitations. Maybe only send invites to confirmed guest? Just curious what other brides are planning","Attachments":[],"Id":1905735,"PostDate":1443693156,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>MegLeLy, on 01 October 2015 - 08:41 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>\nI have all the options and prices.  If you send me your email address I'll forward them to you<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nThank you again! I sent you a private message <br \/>I truly love this site. So incredibly helpful. I'm looking to get married next year at Dreams La Romana 11\/5\/2016 just waiting to hear back from the WC on how to secure my date.  I reached out to HDC for photography they have great prices.  The also can do the Altos De Chavon wedding shoot so I'm excited about that. <br \/>How\/ when is everyone planning to send their save the dates and invitations?  I'm still deciding if I should just do everything online and save some.money but I love the passport invitations. Maybe only send invites to confirmed guest? Just curious what other brides are planning \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nicole.rosario7@gmail.com","IpAddress":"64.233.172.253","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1442143880,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"nr083273","Id":284797,"Name":"nr083273","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.17.41.18","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79546,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1443696791,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3312bd926411e03dda4d03c8e48e098e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I&amp;nbsp;also contacted HDC and they seem great.&amp;nbsp; Still waiting to hear&amp;nbsp;back from a few others I contacted.   I do have the&amp;nbsp;prices from Adventure Photos - which is who Dreams Resorts use.  I&#039;ll try to attach that&amp;nbsp;here if I can figure it out.. if not I&#039;ll send you that too.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m not&amp;nbsp;doing Save the&amp;nbsp;dates and as much as I love the passport invites they just aren&#039;t very budget friendly.&amp;nbsp; I am doing these invites off of Etsy&amp;nbsp;:&amp;nbsp; &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.etsy.com\/listing\/216291256\/dominican-republic-wedding-invitation@ref=fav&#039;&gt;www.etsy.com\/listing\/216291256\/dominican-republic-wedding-invitation&lt;\/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;(only ones I could get my fiance&#039; to agree too! haha - good thing I like them as well)   and then doing a website from &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.appycouple.com&#039;&gt;www.appycouple.com&lt;\/a&gt; to put all the other information on.&amp;nbsp; Will cost me under $100 for invites and the website.&amp;nbsp; I am also sending out invites in the next week or so - that way they have lots of time to book.   Then will probably just send email reminders through my website periodically to those who we don&#039;t know if they are coming or not.&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;Extra Option Prices and Wedding Reception &amp;amp; Buffet\/Dinner Options&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;HDC Photography 2015 packages &amp;amp; Prices&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Adventure Photos 2015 Packages &amp;amp; Prices&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Dreams La Romana Wedding Guide&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1905739,"PostDate":1443697000,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I\u00a0also contacted HDC and they seem great.\u00a0 Still waiting to hear\u00a0back from a few others I contacted.\u00a0\u00a0 I do have the\u00a0prices from Adventure Photos - which is who Dreams Resorts use.\u00a0\u00a0I'll try to attach that\u00a0here if I can figure it out.. if not I'll send you that too.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm not\u00a0doing Save the\u00a0dates and as much as I love the passport invites they just aren't very budget friendly.\u00a0 I am doing these invites off of Etsy\u00a0:\u00a0 <a href='http:\/\/www.etsy.com\/listing\/216291256\/dominican-republic-wedding-invitation@ref=fav' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>www.etsy.com\/listing\/216291256\/dominican-republic-wedding-invitation<\/a>\u00a0(only ones I could get my fiance' to agree too! haha - good thing I like them as well)\u00a0\u00a0 and then doing a website from <a href='http:\/\/www.appycouple.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>www.appycouple.com<\/a> to put all the other information on.\u00a0 Will cost me under $100 for invites and the website.\u00a0 I am also sending out invites in the next week or so - that way they have lots of time to book.\u00a0\u00a0 Then will probably just send email reminders through my website periodically to those who we don't know if they are coming or not.<\/p>\n<br><p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<br \/><p>Extra Option Prices and Wedding Reception & Buffet\/Dinner Options<\/p>\n<br \/><p>HDC Photography 2015 packages & Prices<\/p>\n<p>Adventure Photos 2015 Packages & Prices<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Dreams La Romana Wedding Guide<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"megewy@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"99.17.41.18","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1437848879,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"MegLeLy","Id":284131,"Name":"MegLeLy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"162.90.146.24","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79546,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"38c688cb123ad67491a2d2b25fad1c65","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Megan you are seriously the best!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I love your invitations and I love the idea of having an app. I think its so cool and useful now.&amp;nbsp; I think I am going to follow your path and send out invitations only. I was thinking of sending save the dates to give everyone a year notice and then follow up with an invite but I can just keep everyone updated through the website.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I found a recent bride on tripadvisor and she recommend her photographer Jorge Allocco he&#039;s also on facebook. His website is &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.puntacanaweddingphotographer.com&#039;&gt;www.puntacanaweddingphotographer.com&lt;\/a&gt; and she got her flowers through a local vendor Jardin Constanza and she said the hotel actually gets their flowers from there as well.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;you have been so helpful I&#039;m just hoping I can return the favor&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1905767,"PostDate":1443705890,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Megan you are seriously the best!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I love your invitations and I love the idea of having an app. I think its so cool and useful now.\u00a0 I think I am going to follow your path and send out invitations only. I was thinking of sending save the dates to give everyone a year notice and then follow up with an invite but I can just keep everyone updated through the website.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I found a recent bride on tripadvisor and she recommend her photographer Jorge Allocco he's also on facebook. His website is <a href='http:\/\/www.puntacanaweddingphotographer.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>www.puntacanaweddingphotographer.com<\/a> and she got her flowers through a local vendor Jardin Constanza and she said the hotel actually gets their flowers from there as well.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>you have been so helpful I'm just hoping I can return the favor<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nicole.rosario7@gmail.com","IpAddress":"64.233.172.253","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1442143880,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"nr083273","Id":284797,"Name":"nr083273","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.17.41.18","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79546,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"45b6181d47548d4296fd2ad0f7288572","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m so glad I could help... I had tried reaching out to past La Romana brides but could never get a response and glad at least I could help someone.  &lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I will have to check that photographer out.   I wonder if the resort charges for you to bring in outside flowers, because I think their flower prices are ridiculous.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1905796,"PostDate":1443727699,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I'm so glad I could help... I had tried reaching out to past La Romana brides but could never get a response and glad at least I could help someone.\u00a0\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I will have to check that photographer out.\u00a0\u00a0 I wonder if the resort charges for you to bring in outside flowers, because I think their flower prices are ridiculous.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"megewy@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"99.17.41.18","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1437848879,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"MegLeLy","Id":284131,"Name":"MegLeLy","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":16,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
